            recommendations, presentations, and implementation plans for clients
            and senior stakeholders.
          </li>
          <li>Provided white-glove consulting services.</li>
          <li>Built and managed cross-functional teams.</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="resume-subtitle">
          <em>Selected Roles</em>
        </p>

        <div class="experience-grid">
          <div>SEO Consultant, <strong>Botify</strong></div>
          <div>Senior SEO Manager, <strong>Polygence</strong></div>

          <div>Senior Manager of SEO, <strong>BARK Inc.</strong></div>
          <div>
            SEO Manager,
            <strong>Merriam-Webster &amp; Encyclopaedia Britannica</strong>
          </div>

          <div>
            Content Strategist &amp; SEO Analyst,
            <strong>Investopedia</strong>
          </div>
          <div>Digital Analyst, <strong>Resolute Digital</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
